+|---|---|---|
+| REQ-LEARN-4128 | Proposed (python/carnot/experiment_4128_carnot_verifier_graft_sudoku.py, Exp 4128) | Proposed (tests/python/test_experiment_4128_carnot_verifier_graft_sudoku.py) |
